    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Grimes are delighted to bring to the market No. 23 Turnstone, a superb two-bedroom ground floor apartment ideally positioned within the highly sought-after Barnageeragh Cove development.\n\nBuilt in 2021 with an A-rated BER, this stylish apartment presents in show house condition throughout and offers bright, well-proportioned accommodation with the added benefit of own-door access and a private south-facing rear terrace.\n\nThe accommodation comprises a welcoming entrance hall with excellent storage, a spacious open-plan kitchen/living/dining area, two generous double bedrooms, including a master bedroom with ensuite, and a main bathroom. The open-plan living space provides a lovely setting for both everyday living and entertaining, while the south-facing paved private rear terrace is a fantastic addition. Residents also benefit from fob access to the large communal gardens, providing generous additional outdoor space.\n\nThe location is a real highlight, with Barnageeragh Beach directly adjacent to the development and the beautiful grounds of Ardgillan Castle within easy walking distance. Skerries town centre is also within easy reach, offering a fantastic selection of shops, cafs, restaurants, schools, sporting facilities and local amenities. The area is well served by public transport, with Skerries train station providing regular services to Dublin City Centre.\n\nNo. 23 Turnstone is an ideal choice for first-time buyers, those looking to downsize or investors seeking a modern, low-maintenance home in an excellent coastal location.\n\nFoyer 1.79 m x 1.19 m\nBright entrance hallway with large storage closet tiled flooring\n\nUtility 3.83 m x 1.35 m\nUtililty room, plumbed for washing machine\n\nKitchen 2.26 m x 2.51 m\nBeautiful modern high gloss kitchen with integrated appliances\n\nLiving/Dining Area 6.43 m x 7.32 m\nSpacious open plan living and dining area\n\nPrimary Bedroom 3.19 m x 3.14 m\nPositioned to rear of apartment with contemporary style wardrobes by BeSpace, carpet flooring and access to the outdoor paved terrace area.\n\nBedroom 2 4.95 m x 2.41 m\nSpacious double bedroom with wardrobe from BeSpace, carpet flooring and large floor to ceiling window\n\nEnsuite Bathroom 1.22 m x 2.01 m\nShower, WC washhand basin, tiled flooring\n\nBathroom 1.72 m x 2.01 m\nBath, WC Wash basin, with tiled flooring\n\n\nNotice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
      {
